 respect to $x$ and $y:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=2x,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=-4y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s$ and $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =2s\\operatorname{sin}⁡t, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x$ and $y$ with respect to $s,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂s} & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡t, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂s} & =t\\operatorname{cos}⁡s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂s} & =\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{∂x}{∂s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{∂y}{∂s} \\\\  & =(2s\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)+(-4t\\operatorname{sin}⁡s)(t\\operatorname{cos}⁡s) \\\\  & =2s{sin}^{2}⁡t-4{t}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡s\\operatorname{cos}⁡s \\\\  & =2s{sin}^{2}⁡t-2{t}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2s.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385365 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385366 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385367 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385368 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186385369 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186385366 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385364 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9c5d0091-d440-5a1e-b574-7e1631c61ea7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385365 #edb/ref 1080 "2s{cos}^{2}⁡t-2t\\operatorname{sin}⁡2s" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385365 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186385365 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0e42d90a-97cf-5414-b80d-82a4862b83de" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175921863